    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkidetidet e Nebukadnesa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore to lari li are le nkitoria e Nebukadnesa, neidetidet Nebukadnesa nenyamalu oltau lenye, neimin ninye njo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.41.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 41.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitanapisho ilo aiguanani nchere ore ilkuyantik, o lasakutok o loas inenking'asia o Lkaldayo neiturrurruni te nebo pee etum aatoliki olaiguanani enkidetidet enye. Nejing'u ninche nepuonu aaitashe te dukuya olaiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki olaiguanani ninche, “Aidetideta duoo, netanyamala oltau lai eyieu neyiolou ina kidetidet.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Ilkaldayo olaiguanani, “Lo aiguanani, tobiko ntarasi! Toliki isinkan linono enkidetidet, pee kintodol iyie enkibalakinoto enye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki olaiguanani Ilkaldayo ajoki, “Ore ilo rorei opuku ti atua nanu naa kedede; te nimikintayiololo intae nanu enkidetidet o empukunoto enye, nedung'udung'i intae aaitaa ndung'udung'ot, neidaikieki nkajijik inyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake te nintodolulu intae ina kidetidet o empukunoto enye, niyookiki aang'amu te nanu nkishorot, o nchuneti o enkanyit kitok. Metaa entoduaaki nanu ina kidetidet o enkibalakinoto enye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newalu ninche aaigil eni are, “Nchoo olaiguanani eliki isinkan lenyena enkidetidet, pee kintodolu iyiook enkibalakinoto enye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newalu olaiguanani ajo, “Ayiolo aitisip nchere, erishata intae ing'oruru, enkaraki nitoduaa intae aajo aauno nanu olomoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nchere ti nimimbalunyenye intae ina kidetidet te nanu, naa ena nabo ake endung'okinoto inyi e nkiguana. Itoning'okinote intae pee iroro elejare o lemeitoriori te dukuya nanu o meibelekenyata nkatitin. Metaa entolikioki nanu enkidetidet pee ayiolou nchere eikindimidimi aatoliki enkibalakinoto enye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki Ilkaldayo olaiguanani aajoki, “Meetae hoo oltung'ani te nkop oidim aitabai ena yieunoto o laiguanani; amu meetae aekata olaiguanani kitok aashu ogol oikilikuanua embae naaijo ena too loibonok pooki o too lasakutok, o too Lkaldayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ena bae naikilikuanu olaiguanani naa kegol, nemeetae likae oidim aitoduaa ninye olaiguanani meteleku ake nkaitin, naa ore emanyisho enye neme te nebo iloata seseni loo nkiri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ena negoro olaiguanani nerasu oleng te ngoro neitanapisho nchere ore lelo tung'ana pooki ang'eni le Babilon neidaikieki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eibulayie ina kitanapata nchere ore lelo tung'ana ang'eni naa keari metuata, neing'oru ninche Daniel o lelo le ncholiek enye, pee ear ninche metuata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eitoduaa Enkai Daniel enkipirta enkidetidet",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki Daniel Ariok, ilo kitok le rripore o laiguanani, to losek o tenkarriyiano, laa ninye apa oshomo aar metuata iltung'ana ang'eni le Babilon; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejoki ninye Ariok, ilo kitok le rripore o laiguanani, “Kainyoo pee errish oleng ena kitanapata o laiguanani?” Neitayiolo taa Ariok Daniel ina bae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelo Daniel atua aji nesai olaiguanani meishoo ninye enkata pee etum aitoduaa olaiguanani enkibalakinoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Daniel alo atua enkaji enye, neitayiolo ina bae Hanania, o Mishael o Asaria, lelo le ncholiek enye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejoki ninche meing'oru olng'ur le Nkai e shumata ti alo ena kisudoroto, pee meidaaya ake Daniel o lelo le ncholiek enye te nebo lelo ang'eni le Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neboluni taa ina kisudoroto aaitodol Daniel te nduaata e kewarie. Neisis Daniel Enkai e shumata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Daniel: “Meisisi enkarna e Nkai ntarasi o ntarasi, amu enenye eng'eno o enkidimata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eibelekeny ninye nkatitin o rishat; eiwuang'ie ninye ilaiguanak neput ilaiguanak; neisho ninye eng'eno nagut lelo ng'eni o eyiolounoto; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eitodolu ninye mbaa naagut oo nkisudorot; neyiolo ninye ina natii atua enaimin, naa ninye ebikie ewang'an. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyie, Enkai o loo papa, aaisho nanu enashe o enkisisa, amu kinchoo nanu eng'eno o engolon, nikintayiolo nanu nena nikinkilikuanutua te iyie, amu ntayiolo iyie iyiook ina bae naipirta olaiguanani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etolikio Daniel olaiguanani enkibalakinoto e nkidetidet",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelo taa Daniel atua ine netii Ariok, laa ninye etegelua olaiguanani meidaikie lelo tung'ana ang'eni le Babilon, nelo ajoki ninye nji, “Mindaikie iyie lelo tung'ana ang'eni le Babilon; torikoki nanu mashomo dukuya olaiguanani, pee alo aitodol olaiguanani ina kibalakinoto.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neriku Ariok Daniel aitasieku aitijing'u meitasho te dukuya olaiguanani nelo ajoki ninye nji: “Anoto nanu ti atua lelo yarunoto ooing'uaa Yuda oltung'ani oidim aitayiolo olaiguanani ina kibalakinoto.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki olaiguanani Daniel, laa keji apa enkarna enye Belteshasa, “Eikindim iyie aitayiolo nanu ina kidetidet natoduaa o enkibalakinoto enye?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki Daniel olaiguanani ajoki, “Meetae iltung'ana ang'eni, anaa iloontaleng'o, anaa ilkuyantik, aashu laaing'urak loo lakir ooidim aaitoduaa olaiguanani ina kisudoroto naikilikuanua, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake etii Enkai e shumata naa ninye nabolu nkisudorot neitayiolo ninye olaiguanani Nebukadnesa ina nayooki aaku too nkolong'i e siadi. Ore ina kidetidet ino o nena duaat e lukunya ino ina kata irragita te ndapash naa ninche kuna: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te iyie, lo aiguanani, ina kata irrag te ndapash, nepuonu ndamunot oo naaidim aataa te siadi; naa ore ilo oibalunye nkisudorot nikintayiolo iyie ina nayooki aaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore te nanu, mme te nkaraki eng'eno ai naata alang pooki ooishu pee eibalunyeki ena kisudoroto te nanu, kake pee etumi aaitayiolo olaiguanani enkibalakinoto enye, pee itum atayiolo indamunot o ltau lino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Itoduaa iyie, lo aiguanani, naa ng'ura, enkitanyaanyukoto kitok. Ore ena kitanyaanyukoto kitok oleng neeta ewang'an nawang oleng, neitashe te dukuya iyie, naa tenidol keitureisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore endukuya ena kitanyaanyukoto naa ene sahabu nasila, ore olgoo lenye o nkaik naa ine nkosholai, ore enkoshoke enye o nkupesir naa ino suyai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore nkejek enyena naa ine sekenkei, ore ndapi enyena oo nkejek naa olkuroti oshula esekenkei o enterit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore anaa enitoduaa etebeluaki osoit neme te nkaina e tung'ani nesulakino aosh ina kitanyaanyukoto nena kejek enyena naashula esekenkei o esarng'ab nebel ninche aitaa mbelibelat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku ore ina sekenkei, o ina sarng'ab o ilo suyai, o ina osholai o ina sahabu nerrarra pooki aaku mbelibelat netiu anaa suut ewueji neidong'ieki enkurma te nkata e nkirowuaj, neya ninche olkutati o metaa medoli ninye enkiti enye. Kake ore ilo soit otoosho ina kitanyaanyukoto neaku oldoinyo sapuk neiput enkop pooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ena apa ina kidetidet; naa eikiliki naa taata iyiook olaiguanani enkibalakinoto enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore iyie, Laaiguanani, nira olaiguanani loo laiguanak, laa iyie eishoo Enkai e shumata enkitoria, o engolon, o enkidimata, o enkitoo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa atua nkaik inono etipika ninye, eneba anaa enemanya tung'ani, o ng'uesi e ong'ata, o ntaritik o loing'ang'e, nikintaa iyie olaitoriani te shumata ninche pooki - iyie ina dukuya e sahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi iyie nedumunye ae kitoria nemegol anaa enino, o enkae e uni o suyai naa kelo aitore enkop pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kelotu enkitoria e ong'uan, nagol anaa esekenkei, amu kebel esekenkei ntokitin pooki neitaa empunyua; naa ore anaa esekenkei napurdisho kebel nepurd kuna pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore anaa enitoduaa ndapi enyena oo nkejek o lkimojik aa esarng'ab, o laitobirani eshula o esekenkei keaku enkitoria naoro; kake ore embata ndapai e sekenkei keaku ketii atua ninye, anaa ake enitoduaa esekenkei eshula o enterit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore anaa enitoduaa lelo kimojik loo nkejek aa esekenkei nashula o enterit neijia etiu ina kitoria kegol ti ae alo neshal ti ae alo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore anaa enitoduaa iyie esekenkei eshula o esarng'ab neijia etiu eshula maate aayama, kake meibung'a maate aaku nabo, anaa ake enemeibung'a esekenkei o enterit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ti atua nkolong'i e lelo aiguanak neun Enkai e shumata enkitoria merruoyo ae kata, ore enkitoria enye meya ae kata kulikae tung'ana, naa kerrar ninye nkitoriat pooki neiting'ie ninche, neitashe ninye ntarasi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anaa ake enitoduaa nchere etebeluaki osoit to ldoinyo neme te nkaina e tung'ani nerrar ina sekendei, o suyai, o enterit, o enkosholai o ina sahabu. Enkai kitok naitayiolo olaiguanani ina nayooki atiu te siadi. Kedede ina kidetidet nesipa enkibalakinoto enye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishoo olaiguanani Daniel enkishooroto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebatata olaiguanani Nebukadnesa te nkomom enye, neserem ninye Daniel, neitanapisho pee ei taikini ninye olasar nepejokini enkorropil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki olaiguanani Daniel, “Esipa ore Enkai ino naa Enkai oo nkaitin naa Olaitoriani loo laiguanak, naa olaitodolunoni loo nkisudorot, amu indima iyie atabolu ena kisudoroto.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neisho ilo aiguanani Daniel enkitoo e shumata o nkishorot kumok sapuki neisho ninye meitoria olosho e nkop e Babilon pooki, neitaa sii ninye olkitok loo lang'eni pooki le Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neikilikuanu Daniel to laiguanani, negelu ninye Shadrak, o Meshak o Abednego metaa ninche ooing'or mbaa e nkop e Babilon; kake etobiko ninye Daniel to lgoriet te nkaji o laiguanani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
